<section class="cs__sec" aria-labelledby="s7">
  <p class="st-k rv">07 · Handoff</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s7">Ready for development and QA</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    I organised the Figma file for the people building and testing it: one section per flow, each
    with its last update date, and the screens in the order a user meets them.
  </p>
  <div class="st-grid st-g3 st-wide">
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Step 1 · Mapped</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">Workflow and roles</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">The document journey and three user roles set the structure of the product.</p>
    </div>
